ors on the same input, persist both raw JSONs.\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/orchestrate.py:25:def _load_system_prompt() -> str:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/orchestrate.py:39:) -> str:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/orchestrate.py:51:        \"Produce the JSON annotation per the protocol described in the system message.\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/orchestrate.py:68:) -> dict[str, Optional[dict[str, Any]]]:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/orchestrate.py:86:    out_dir = Path(raw_dir) / case_id / condition / component_kind\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/orchestrate.py:98:        except Exception as e:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/orchestrate.py:112:        except Exception as e:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/README.md:3:LLM-初审 + 人类签字 的 5-component manual-eval pipeline，用于 paper §Evaluation 的 component-level P/R/F1。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/README.md:7:- 5 类 component：`states / transitions / guards / actions / hierarchical_states`\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/README.md:59:│   ├── refs/<case>/             # ref_components.json + ref_model.txt（你签字）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/README.md:60:│   └── preds/<case>/            # pred_*.json + pred_*_model.txt（baseline/ours 输出）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/README.md:62:    ├── run_demo.py              # 阶段 3+4：跑 annotation + 渲染评审包\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/README.md:70:| case | condition | TP | FP | FN | F1 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/README.md:84:PYTHONPATH=. python eval/demo/run_demo.py\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/README.md:87:PYTHONPATH=. python eval/demo/finalize_after_signoff.py\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/claude.py:16:``RuntimeError`` for non-zero exit codes and ``ValueError`` for non-JSON\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/claude.py:27:def annotate(*, system_prompt: str, user_prompt: str, timeout_s: int = 300) -> dict[str, Any]:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/claude.py:31:    # Claude `-p` non-interactive takes the user prompt on argv.\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/claude.py:53:            f\"claude CLI exit={result.returncode}; stderr:\\n{result.stderr[-800:]}\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/annotate/claude.py:65:    # The model sometimes wraps JSON in ```json ... ``` despite our prompt.\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:7:### 1.1 写进 paper §Evaluation 的说法（claim）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:9:> \"Adapting the protocol of Apvrille et al. (2025), we manually evaluate generated state machines against expert ground-truth solutions. For each of the five component categories (states / transitions / guards / actions / hierarchical states), an expert annotator classifies every generated component as TP (exact or semantic match) / FP (no equivalent in ground-truth) / FN (ground-truth element with no generated equivalent), with the strict cascade rule: transitions on FP-states automatically count as FP, and guards/actions on FP-transitions cascade as FP.\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:19:2. 自动：组装 annotation prompt（含原 NL + ref 模型 + pred 模型 + ref/pred 抽出的 instance 列表）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:20:3. 自动：并行跑两个 annotator（Claude Code 与 gpt-5.5）各自产 annotation JSON\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:39:| 1 | `states` | `Name { ... }` 块 | `state Name { ... }` 块 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:40:| 2 | `transitions` | `event [guard] /action -> Target;` | `Src -> Tgt : if [guard] effect { ... };` 或 `Src -> Tgt :: event` |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:41:| 3 | `guards` | transition 中 `[guard_expr]` | transition 中 `if [guard_expr]` |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:42:| 4 | `actions` | transition 上 `/action_code`（**仅 transition 上**，不含 entry/exit/do） | transition 中 `effect { ... }`（**仅 transition 上**） |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:43:| 5 | `hierarchical_states` | 嵌套 state 块 | composite state（含 child states） |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:56:   - state name 不同但代表同一系统模式（如 `Off` vs `PoweredDown`）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:57:   - superstate / parallel region name 不同但**包含同一组 matching substates**\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:58:   - guard / action 表达式不同但语义等价（如 `x >= 30` vs `x > 29`）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:63:1. transition 的 src/tgt state 是 FP-state ⇒ 该 transition 自动 FP\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:64:2. guard 挂在 FP-transition 上 ⇒ 该 guard 自动 FP\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:65:3. action 挂在 FP-transition 上 ⇒ 该 action 自动 FP\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:82:### 3.5 pyfcstm forced transition 的声明级评测口径\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:84:pyfcstm 运行时会把 `!` forced transition 展开为多个 leaf-level 行为边；但 Path 1 / Path 2 的人工签字包和 component-level F1 按 **DSL declaration-level component** 计数。也就是说，一行 `! * -> Safe : if [fault == 1];` 在 `transitions` 中只算 1 个 forced transition component；若该 forced declaration 带 guard，则在 `guards` 中只算 1 个 guard component；展开到多少个 descendant leaf 只作为 `expansion_count` 审计字段保留，不进入 TP/FP/FN 分母。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:96:数据集为我们自建的 [`../sources/`](../sources/) 控制系统 NL 文库；按以下规则筛选 Path 1 / Path 2 各自的 evaluation 子集：\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:126:- NL 只描述硬件 IO，无明确 STM 抽象的（state machine 隐性）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:139:原 v3 sprint plan §4.2 把 Path 1 dataset 锁定在 `structure_event_driven` 8 cases。**v4 已切换到 sources/**：原因是 structure_event 9 个 case GT 均含 `reference_history_states_count ≥ 1`（每个 case 至少有一个 `.H` history pseudo-state），与 pyfcstm 形式不支持的范围冲突；按 §4.3 排除规则全部剔除后 dataset 为空。改用 sources/ 后我们对 reference 5-component IR 有完全的人工构建控制权，paper claim \"small-scale manual benchmark\" 更清晰，与 [评测口径分析 §6.4 第 5 条](../discussions/2026-04-15-14-51-21-AI-讨论-baselines双绿输入文本与sources样例对比及评测口径分析.md) 的建议一致。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:148:- **ref 原文**：`Off { on -> On; }`\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:149:- **pred 原文**：`Off { entry/{}; on -> On; }`\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:151:  - 理由：state name `Off` 完全相同，purpose 一致\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:166:- 备注可写理由（paper 后续 ablation 也许会用到）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:170:- **methodology 段**：本文 §1.1 paper claim 原文 + manual evaluation 声明 + \"评测 5 类组件\" 范围声明\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/PROTOCOL.md:177:2. 提供两条独立 annotation 提案，让人类对低置信样本做 second-look\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:32:### 4.1 按 case × condition × component\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:34:| case_id | condition | component | TP | FP | FN | P | R | F1 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:38:| abs-fsm-brake-control | pred_buggy | 迁移（`transitions`） | 4 | 2 | 1 | 0.667 | 0.800 | **0.727** |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:41:| abs-fsm-brake-control | pred_perfect | 迁移（`transitions`） | 4 | 0 | 0 | 1.000 | 1.000 | **1.000** |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:43:| automatic-elevator-controller | pred_buggy | 迁移（`transitions`） | 9 | 1 | 2 | 0.900 | 0.818 | **0.857** |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:45:| automatic-elevator-controller | pred_perfect | 迁移（`transitions`） | 11 | 0 | 0 | 1.000 | 1.000 | **1.000** |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:47:### 4.2 按 case × condition 的 macro F1（5-component 平均）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:49:| case_id | condition | components_scored | macro F1 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:56:### 4.3 按 condition 的 overall F1（aggregate TP/FP/FN）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:58:| condition | TP | FP | FN | P | R | F1 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:72:| `packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_buggy/transitions.md` | row001 | 🟡 仅 Claude | TP→— | 采纳 Claude | TP |  |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:73:| `packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_buggy/transitions.md` | row005 | 🟡 仅 gpt-5.5 | —→FN | 采纳 gpt-5.5 | FN |  |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/results/REPORT.md:74:| `packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_buggy/transitions.md` | row006 | 🟡 仅 gpt-5.5 | —→FP | 采纳 gpt-5.5 | FP |  |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:3:> **本文件目标**：任何新 Claude / codex session 进入 `dev/path1-hard-comparison` branch 后，按本指引可直接接管，把 Path 1 quick experiment 推进到 sprint 末。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:19:> \"We propose an agent loop architecture that integrates pyfcstm's deterministic verifier feedback (parse / semantic / simulation, with scenario-based bug-finding probes via scenariogen self-managed mutation coverage) as in-loop feedback signals. We adapt the manual-evaluation protocol of Apvrille et al. (2025) — originally on the `structure_event_driven` UML statechart benchmark — to our small-scale industrial-control-system benchmark (`sources/` T0+🟢 subset, $N$=5-10 cases stratified across FSM/EFSM/HSM, 5-component manual eval). On these inputs, the prior best strategy (Hybrid SMF) re-run under GPT-5.5 achieves macro-F1 = $X$, while our method lifts it to $Y$. Improvements are particularly pronounced on `guards / actions / hierarchical states`, which prior work identified as the hardest components.\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:23:完整 6-baseline 对照表见 [discussion §4.4](../discussions/2026-05-26-15-30-00-AI-讨论-第一篇论文agent-loop闭环2日冲刺计划.md#44-6-个主力-baseline-方法学全景v3-新增)。Path 1 sprint 阶段**只与 structure_event_driven Hybrid 对照**（但跑在我们的 sources/ T0+🟢 子集上，而非 structure_event 原数据集），其他 5 个 baseline（llms_emp / ttool-ai / IEC 61499 / Llama3 Umple / Automated Statechart Automotive）作为方向定后正式 paper 阶段的工作。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:30:| ttool-ai 自动反馈循环 (JSON/syntax check + post-hoc sim) | 输出是多 block AVATAR design 不是单 STM；task 不完全对齐 | paper §4.x discussion 段落讨论；不重跑实验，引用 paper 报告数字 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:31:| IEC 61499 仿真精化 (softPLC + 人类评论) | 需要 EAE / softPLC 环境部署；本质是 human-in-the-loop pipeline，与我们的 fully automated 范式不直接可比 | paper §5 discussion 段落讨论 \"fully automated vs human-in-the-loop\" trade-off |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:32:| Llama3 Umple (Zero/One/RAG) | 模型代差大（Llama 3 8B vs GPT-5.5）；不公平对照 | paper §4.x 补 LLM model-comparison 附表 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:38:2. **Reproducibility** 强 — baseline 复现代码在 [`baseline_structure_event.py`](../reproduction/baselines/baseline_structure_event.py)，sources/ NL 公开在仓库 [`sources/`](../sources/)；evaluation 全程 audit-trail 留痕（见 [`../eval/PROTOCOL.md`](../eval/PROTOCOL.md) §1.3）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:43:`A_full_ours - A0_strong` 这个 lift 反映的不是\"我们比 baseline 强多少\"，而是 **pyfcstm 外部 deterministic verifier feedback + scenariogen 自管 mutation coverage 作为 in-loop bug-finding probe** 相对于 **纯 prompt-based 多步 + 规则后处理** 的增量贡献。这正是 paper §1 contributions 第 1-3 条的实验证据：\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:49:> **Phase H (judge) 跳过说明**：sprint 阶段不接入 LLM-as-judge 第 4 个 feedback channel；`A_full_ours = parse+semantic+sim` 三通道（含 scenariogen self-managed 覆盖率）。判定 sprint 信号时也无 ex1 judge 贡献。Judge 留作方向定后正式 paper 阶段补充，原 v3 contribution 列表的 \"Reachability witness as structured prompt input\" 与 \"LLM-as-judge as in-loop semantic feedback\" 两条仍是 paper §1 contribution 候选，但不依赖 sprint 验证。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:51:完整 6 条 contribution 见 [discussion §4.5](../discussions/2026-05-26-15-30-00-AI-讨论-第一篇论文agent-loop闭环2日冲刺计划.md#45-我们的核心创新点v3-新增)。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:68:python -c \"from pyfcstm.dsl import parse_with_grammar_entry; print('ok')\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:84:test -f project_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/reproduction/baselines/baseline_structure_event.py && echo \"baseline_structure_event ok\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:111:| 切换原因 | — | structure_event 9 个 case GT 均含 `reference_history_states_count ≥ 1`；与 pyfcstm 形式不支持的范围冲突，整 dataset 被排除 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:112:| baseline 对手 | Hybrid SMF on structure_event NL | **Hybrid SMF 重跑在 sources/ NL 上**（同 input, 不同 method）|\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:151:- NL 只描述硬件 IO，无明确 STM 抽象的（state machine 隐性）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:157:### 4.1 `A0_strong` — baseline structure_event Hybrid 在 GPT-5.5 + sources/ NL 上重跑\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:162:from reproduction.baselines.baseline_structure_event import run_hybrid  # 通用 NL 入口\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:175:1. `baseline_structure_event.py` 接口能接受 **NL string + 外部 llm_client**（不要 hardcode 在 structure_event case_id 列表里）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:176:2. 如果原代码 hardcode 了 GPT-4o client 或 structure_event case 索引，需要花 30min-1h 重构为通用 NL 入口 + 外部 client 注入（统一走 method.g