SON_GUIDE.md:282:| `actions` | transition 上 /effect 子句（**仅 transition actions**） | 表达式集合 | **baseline §IV-B 明确排除 state entry/exit/do actions** |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:283:| `hierarchical_states` | composite state 名集合 | 名称集合 | superstate 含相同 substates 视为等价 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:303:baseline §IV-A 用 manual single-author evaluation 判定语义等价（\"components that are intended to represent the same concept ... are graded as equivalent, even if their names differ\"）。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:317:**paper §4 evaluation 仅描述人工评测协议**，双 LLM 预审作为 internal tooling 仅在 §6 / appendix 简短提及（\"to improve evaluator efficiency, we used two independent LLM annotators to propose initial classifications which were then manually verified row-by-row by the author; rows where the two annotators agreed were auto-pre-marked with the agreed label and confirmed by the author; rows where they disagreed required explicit author decision\"）。这是工业界 SE 论文常用做法 — LLM-assisted labeling 但 final label 视为 human gold；双 annotator 设计额外提供 inter-LLM agreement signal 帮助评测者聚焦低置信度 / 分歧行。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:323:| 组件清单 | 7 类：states / transitions / guards / actions / hierarchical / parallel / history | **5 类**（去 parallel / history，pyfcstm 形式不支持，paper 不主张覆盖） | **subset**（paper §6 limitations 显式声明）|\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:324:| `actions` 范围 | 仅 transition actions, **排除 state entry/exit/do** | 同（按 baseline 严格执行） | **一致** |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:325:| Strict cascade rule | transitions to non-matching states 自动 FP；依赖 FP transition 的 guards/actions 自动 FP | 同 | **一致** |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:329:| Semantic equivalence 判定 | manual single-author evaluation | **manual single-evaluator**（双 LLM 预审仅作内部提效辅助，不进 paper protocol） | **一致** |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:330:| Ground-truth 来源 | 8 个本科课程题的 expert-drawn diagrams | **`sources/` T0+🟢 5-10 cases 工业控制系统 NL** + 评测者手工构建 5-component reference IR | **不同 dataset，同 ground-truth-construction methodology** |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:333:**核心 protocol 与 baseline 一致**（TP/FP/FN 定义、strict cascade、overall F1 计算）；dataset 切到 sources/ 是我们引入的差异，paper §6 limitations 显式声明 + §Discussion 说明 method 在 sources/ 工业 NL 上的可迁移性预期。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:360:eval/review/raw/<case>/<cond>/<kind>/{claude,codex}.json   # 双 annotator 原始 JSON\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:366:eval/results/detail.parquet                                # per case × condition × component\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:367:eval/results/macro_per_case.parquet                        # per case × condition macro F1\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:368:eval/results/overall_per_condition.parquet                 # per condition overall F1\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:376:2. **§2 主结果表**：`A0_strong` (Hybrid on sources/ NL @ GPT-5.5) vs `A_full_ours` 的 5 类组件 P/R/F1 + overall-F1，行=组件，列=method（数据源：`eval/results/full_annotations.parquet`）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:378:4. **§4 signal 判定**：按 [discussion §4.1](../discussions/2026-05-26-15-30-00-AI-讨论-第一篇论文agent-loop闭环2日冲刺计划.md) 的 S1/S2/S3/S4 把当前数据归类\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:381:7. **§7 后续 paper 工作量预估**：若选 Path 1，1-2 个月内要补的工作（扩 sources/ 到 30-50 cases / cross-vendor / 完整 ablation A1/A2/A3 / 接 Phase H judge 补 7-component 维度 等）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:390:| F1 lift 过低（$< 5$pp）信号不显著 | `A_full_ours` 没比 `A0_strong` 好多少 | 按 [discussion §4.1](../discussions/2026-05-26-15-30-00-AI-讨论-第一篇论文agent-loop闭环2日冲刺计划.md) S4 处理，在 PATH1_REPORT.md §6 给出\"信号弱\"判定，由用户综合判断 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:391:| `baseline_structure_event.py` 不接受外部 NL | Phase 0 verify 时发现接口 hardcode 了 structure_event case 索引 | 花 30min-1h 重构为通用 NL 入口 + 外部 client 注入；fallback 用 single-prompt baseline 替代 Hybrid（在 PATH1_REPORT §1 明确披露），不阻塞 sprint |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:392:| A0_strong 和 A_full_ours DSL 格式不同导致评测不公平 | Umple 抽 transitions / pyfcstm 抽 transitions 算出不同语义 | [`../eval/extract/`](../eval/extract/) 已统一为 5-component `ComponentSet`；不一致样本标 confounder，PATH1_REPORT §6 披露 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:402:- [ ] `python eval/demo/finalize_after_signoff.py` 成功跑完（无 `UnsignedRowsError`）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:409:## 11. Method + Contribution 详述（paper writing 直接复用素材）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:411:> 本节集中讲清楚 Path 1 视角下我们的 method 是什么、contribution 是什么；既给 sprint 末 PATH1_REPORT.md §7 (Claude 方向建议) 提供 anchored framing，也给方向定后正式 paper §1 contributions + §3 method 提供直接可复用的写作素材。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:420:      |  6 步 MTI 流水 (identify_state → identify_event → identify_variable →\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:421:      |                identify_transition → identify_action → build_pyfcstm)\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:442:  next_model --> 回到 Feedback Sources, iterate N=3 rounds\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:445:  final_model (pyfcstm DSL) --> 进入 §6 评测协议算 P/R/F1 vs A0_strong\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:452:1. **MTI 6-step Multi-step Modeler**（PR #11 Phase F 实装）：NL → 6 步流水（identify_state → identify_event → identify_variable → identify_transition → identify_action → build_pyfcstm）→ pyfcstm DSL\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:455:   - 替代方案 single_prompt（同代码内 `LoopConfig.modeling_mode=\"single_prompt\"`）作 ablation 对照\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:456:2. **ScenarioGen**（PR #11 Phase G+E v3 实装）：NL + 模型 → 多 step BDD scenarios + 6 mutation 覆盖率自检\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:457:   - **scenariogen self-validation**：scenariogen 后自动跑 6-mutation 覆盖率检查；任一类未被 catch → 用 `extra_directive` retry 直到覆盖\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:460:   - 按 earliest-failing channel 路由；fix_sim 含 passing-scenarios 显式 preservation 段\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:461:   - **prompt 显式约束**：\"按 feedback 中的具体错误指针 (line/col/state/transition) 做定向修复，不要大改\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:465:| Source | pyfcstm 入口 | 输出 schema 核心字段 | 在 paper §3 method 里是哪一条 contribution |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:468:| Semantic | `pyfcstm.model.parse_dsl_node_to_state_machine` | `{ok, missing_states, dangling_transitions, undefined_vars, type_mismatches}` | C2 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:469:| Sim | `pyfcstm.simulate.SimulationRuntime` + scenariogen 多 step BDD probes（含 6-mutation 自检） | `{ok, scenario_violations, per_step_var_mismatches, runtime_error}` | **C1 + C2 + C3 + C4** (speculative validation + Z3 ready + aspect/forced 在这一路触达) |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:475:- **scenariogen frozen-once**：scenarios 在 iter 循环外生成一次 + mutation 覆盖率自检；model 适配 scenarios 不反向\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:479:### 11.3 Contribution 详述（**Path 1 视角：method 为主，empirical lift 作 evidence**）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:487:> \"We integrate pyfcstm's cycle-based simulation runtime — featuring per-cycle deepcopy-snapshot speculative DFS validation bounded by 1000 steps, 64 stack frames, and structural-and-value signature pruning (`pyfcstm/simulate/runtime.py:_validate_transition` and `_run_cycle_on_context`) — as a **deterministic in-loop feedback source** for LLM-driven STM synthesis. Unlike Umple's generate-then-execute pipeline, pyfcstm rejects transitions whose downstream init / pseudo / parent-continuation chains cannot reach a stoppable boundary, and surfaces a structured `SimulationRuntimeDfsError` whose docstring enumerates the exact pathological patterns LLMs are known to emit (composite state with no enabled init transition, pseudo-state chains that never settle, mutually-blocking guards, exit-vs-parent-continuation cycles). This converts model checking from an offline batch artifact into an **online repair signal**.\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:489:#### C2 — Language-independent expression IR enables symbolic reasoning without code generation（**method core**）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:491:> \"The DSL ships a unified `Expr` IR (`pyfcstm/model/expr.py`) supporting the full arithmetic / bitwise / logical / ternary / 22-function math closure required by state-machine guards and effects. This same IR is simultaneously (a) numerically evaluable, (b) AST-round-trippable, (c) translatable to Z3 via `pyfcstm/solver/expr.py:expr_to_z3`, and (d) renderable into 9 target-language styles (`pyfcstm/render/expr.py:_KNOWN_STYLES`). We exploit this single IR to provide LLM agents with **guard SMT satisfiability checks** (`pyfcstm/solver/solve.py:solve`) and **symbolic effect propagation** (`pyfcstm/solver/operation.py:execute_operations`) as in-loop feedback signals — without ever leaving the DSL toolchain. Umple's host-language-bound guards cannot offer equivalent.\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:495:> \"We design our method around two pyfcstm DSL-level primitives that Umple and PlantUML lack: (i) **aspect actions** (`>> during before / after`) cascading from root to leaf states at every cycle (`pyfcstm/model/model.py:iter_on_during_aspect_recursively`), enabling first-class encoding of cross-cutting per-tick invariants, monitoring, and logging; and (ii) **forced transitions** (`!`) which the model layer recursively expands to every applicable descendant substate (`pyfcstm/model/model.py:_recursive_finish_states`), giving one-line declarative encoding of global escape paths. Although these primitives were originally motivated by control-system idioms, our experiments demonstrate they also improve STM-synthesis quality on the home-appliance benchmark.\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:497:#### C4 — Abstract action + read-only context decouples symbolic STM from physical effectors（**method core**）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:499:> \"Combining DSL-level abstract action declarations (`enter abstract Init;` / `during abstract Monitor;` / `>> during before abstract LogTick;`) with the Python-side `@abstract_handler` decorator and `ReadOnlyExecutionContext` (`pyfcstm/simulate/decorators.py` + `context.py`) lets the LLM synthesize STMs **without committing to a deployment target**. Handlers are injected at run-time through an immutable frozen context, and two-mode error handling (`abstract_error_mode={raise, log}`) captures handler failures into `error_info` / `abstract_handler_errors` fields for the agent loop to consume. Umple's lifecycle hooks are host-language-bound and provide no equivalent DSL-level abstraction.\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:501:#### C5 — Empirical demonstration on industrial control-system NL benchmark（**evidence section, NOT core contribution**）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:503:> \"On a small-scale industrial-control-system benchmark drawn from `sources/` ($N$=5-10 cases stratified across FSM/EFSM/HSM, T0+🟢 subset, manually constructed 5-component reference models), our method achieves overall-F1 = $X$ on the same model (LLM_MODEL=GPT-5.5), lifting the overall-F1 of the strongest prior strategy (Hybrid SMF, re-run on our `sources/` inputs) by $\\Delta$ percentage points, with the largest gains on `guards / actions / hierarchical_states`, the three categories the prior work identified as hardest on home-appliance / undergrad-course datasets (baseline Hybrid GPT-4o: guards=0.42 / actions=0.34). The choice of `sources/` over the original `structure_event_driven` 8-case dataset is forced by the latter's universal use of history pseudo-states (`history_states_count ≥ 1` in all 8 GTs), which falls outside pyfcstm's expressive scope; this constraint is acknowledged in §6 limitations.\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:505:**This empirical result is not the paper's core contribution** — it is the evidence supporting C1-C4. The core contribution is the method itself. paper §1 应当把 C1-C4 作为 numbered contributions，C5 在 §1 末段作为 \"We empirically validate the method on...\" evidence sentence 给出。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:511:| # | 类别 | contribution |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:513:| 1 | **method** | In-loop deterministic feedback via speculative validation |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:514:| 2 | **method** | Language-independent expression IR enables symbolic reasoning without codegen |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:516:| 4 | **method** | Abstract action + read-only context for effector-agnostic STM synthesis |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:517:| 5 | **evidence** | Empirical demonstration on `sources/` T0+🟢 industrial control-system NL subset over Hybrid baseline re-run on the same inputs |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH1_HARD_COMPARISON_GUIDE.md:519:> 完整 LaTeX 模板 + 引用 key 等 paper drafting 阶段再具体写 — sprint 阶段保留 contribution 列表即可。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:33:    # claude annotation (full)\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:35:    # codex annotation (full)\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:50:def _load_json(p: Path) -> Optional[dict[str, Any]]:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:59:def _index_raw_by_pair(raw_blob: Optional[dict[str, Any]]) -> dict[tuple[Optional[str], Optional[str]], dict[str, Any]]:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:69:def _find_instance_text(instances: list[dict[str, Any]], iid: Optional[str]) -> tuple[str, str]:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:85:def _classify_agreement(claude_row: Optional[dict], codex_row: Optional[dict]) -> str:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:105:) -> pd.DataFrame:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:113:    # cache of (case, kind) -> ref instances\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:117:    def _ref_instances(case_id: str, kind: str) -> list[dict]:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:123:    def _pred_instances(case_id: str, condition: str, kind: str) -> list[dict]:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:130:    # cache of (case, cond, kind) -> (claude_index, codex_index, paths)\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:136:            d = raw_dir / case_id / condition / kind\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:150:        condition = r[\"condition\"]\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:164:        pack_path = packs_dir / case_id / condition / f\"{kind}.md\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:206:def check_signoff_complete(df: pd.DataFrame) -> None:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:224:def _zh(s: str) -> str:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:227:        \"transitions\": \"迁移\",\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:247:def _prf(tp: int, fp: int, fn: int) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:254:def build_report_md(df: pd.DataFrame, *, out_path: Path) -> Path:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:303:        \"### 4.1 按 case × condition × component\",\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:305:        \"| case_id | condition | component | TP | FP | FN | P | R | F1 |\",\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:314:    L += [\"\", \"### 4.2 按 case × condition 的 macro F1（5-component 平均）\", \"\"]\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:315:    L += [\"| case_id | condition | components_scored | macro F1 |\", \"| --- | --- | ---: | ---: |\"]\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:326:    L += [\"\", \"### 4.3 按 condition 的 overall F1（aggregate TP/FP/FN）\", \"\"]\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:327:    L += [\"| condition | TP | FP | FN | P | R | F1 |\", \"| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\"]\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:390:) -> dict[str, Path]:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/report.py:406:    # Sanity check AFTER persisting (so user can still see audit even when refused)\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/README.md:7:1. **Direction-Decision Sprint 阶段**的两路实验决策报告（`PATH1_REPORT.md` / `PATH2_REPORT.md`）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/README.md:8:2. **方向定后**的正式 paper 工作产物（`OUTLINE.md` / 各章节 draft / figures / tables / submission package）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/README.md:13:## 2. 当前阶段 — Direction-Decision Sprint\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/README.md:49:## 4. 新 session 进入顺序\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/README.md:51:任何新 Claude / codex session 进入本目录后，按以下顺序读：\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/README.md:58:   - 若在 `main`：两份 GUIDE 都读，但**只能动 `method/` 共同基础**，不能动 path 特有的 evaluation 代码\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/README.md:64:2. [../baselines/](../baselines/) — Path 1 的数据来源（structure_event T0 子集 + llms_emp stm T0 子集）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/README.md:79:`method/gpt_client.py` 是 sprint 中唯一允许实例化 OpenAI-compatible client 的位置；所有 agent / baseline replication 都 inject 这个 client。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:3:> **本文件目标**：任何新 Claude / codex session 进入 `dev/path2-differentiation` branch 后，按本指引可直接接管，把 Path 2 quick experiment 推进到 sprint 末。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:11:Path 2 = **差异化路线**，主张：**在真实控制系统语料上跑出 intrinsic metrics 显著 lift，paper 主打 reference-free evaluation + agent loop with externally grounded in-loop feedback**。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:15:> \"We tackle NL-to-STM generation for real industrial control system requirements, where canonical reference STMs do not exist at scale. Several recent works have already integrated in-loop feedback into LLM-based STM generation: rule-based grammar/semantics checks (llms_emp), JSON/syntax/constraint checks with TTool simulator (ttool-ai), and softPLC simulation with human-in-the-loop comments (IEC 61499). **However, no existing work integrates (i) parse + semantic + simulation as a unified deterministic verifier signal with scenario-based bug-finding probes via mutation-coverage self-validation, and (ii) speculative validation from the runtime, all in a fully automated, no-human-in-the-loop pipeline targeting industrial control system NL.** We propose (a) an agent loop architecture with the above two components and scenariogen self-managed mutation coverage as in-loop bug-finding probes, and (b) a reference-free 4-intrinsic evaluation protocol with optional small-scale audit-trail calibration. On a 20-case T0 subset of [sources/](../sources/) (real industrial control NL from 9 domains, stratified across FSM/EFSM/HSM), our method lifts the 4-intrinsic mean from $X$ to $Y$, with the largest gains on `SimRate` (+$Z$pp) and `ReachabilityRate` (+$W$pp).\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:17:> **v4 修订说明**：原 v3 主卖点含 \"(ii) LLM-as-judge as in-loop semantic feedback\" 和 \"5-metric mean (含 JudgeScore)\"；sprint 决定 Phase H (judge) 跳过 — 已实装的 3 个 deterministic feedback channel (parse + sem + sim) 加上 Phase E v3 (f) scenariogen 自管 6-mutation 覆盖率自检足以支撑 sprint 决策信号，judge 留作正式 paper 阶段补充。intrinsic 也相应从 5 个简化为 **4 个**（去 JudgeScore），并保留 [`../eval/`](../eval/) audit-trail manual-eval 基础设施作为可选的小规模校准信号（验证 intrinsic 与人类金标准 F1 的 Pearson 相关性）。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:21:完整 6-baseline 对照表（与 [discussion §4.4](../discussions/2026-05-26-15-30-00-AI-讨论-第一篇论文agent-loop闭环2日冲刺计划.md#44-6-个主力-baseline-方法学全景v3-新增) 同源，paper §2 related work 直接复用）：\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:23:| # | baseline | 任务 / 输出 | LLM | 方法核心 | prompt-eng | simulation 反馈 | formal verification 反馈 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:28:| 4 | [Automated Statechart (Automotive)](../baselines/req/DESC.md) (2025) | NL 产品功能需求 → Mermaid statechart | GPT-3.5 / 4 / 4o (微调) | NLP 特征提取 + 合成数据扩充 + 领域微调 | 中（prompt-completion 对 + 数据增广） | 低（Mermaid 渲染 + 专家评审） | **无** |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:29:| 5 | [Llama3 Umple](../baselines/umple/DESC.md) (2025) | NL → Umple state machine | Llama 3 (8B) | Zero-shot / One-shot / RAG 提示策略对比 | 高（系统消息 + RAG 选例） | **中**（Umple 可执行性 / pass@k 检查） | **低**（依赖 Umple 编译 / 语义可执行性，非独立 formal proof） |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:36:1. **没有任何 baseline 同时做 parse + semantic + sim 三路并列反馈**：llms_emp 只 a+b（grammar / semantics rule-based），ttool-ai 主要 a+b（JSON / syntax），IEC 61499 主要 c（simulation 但需人介入）。Path 2 sprint 做的是 parse + sem + sim 三路 + **scenariogen 自管 6-mutation 覆盖率自检** 作为 in-loop bug-finding probes，覆盖 syntax / semantics / executability / bug-detection 4 个正交维度。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:38:3. **没有任何 baseline 做 speculative validation from runtime**：pyfcstm `SimulationRuntime` 在 execute transition 前 speculatively validate，其他工具链不给。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:39:4. **没有任何 baseline 做 fully automated control system NL-to-STM**：IEC 61499 是唯一做控制系统 + simulation feedback，但需要人类评论介入；其他 baseline 不做控制系统（家电 / domain model / 通用 reactive system / 系统级 spec）。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:40:5. **没有任何 baseline 提出 reference-free evaluation protocol**：所有 baseline 都依赖 reference STM 做 F1 评测。控制系统真实场景下不存在 canonical reference STM（同一需求可对应多个等价 STM），ref-based F1 在 construct level 就不成立。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:42:> **关于 reachability witness 与 LLM-as-judge 的两条**：原 v3 §1.2 把 \"Reachability witness in loop\" 和 \"LLM-as-judge as in-loop semantic feedback\" 列为我们的差异化点。v4 sprint 阶段两者均未实装：reachability witness 接口 (`pyfcstm.topology`) 主要在 dev 分支有，sprint 不依赖；LLM-as-judge (Phase H) 跳过。两者保留为 paper §3 method discussion 中的\"工具链 ready，已规划但 sprint 范围外\"列项，正式 paper 阶段补做。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:46:> **v4 修订**：原 v3 含 6 条 contribution；C3 (Reachability witness as structured prompt input) 与 C5 (LLM-as-judge as in-loop semantic feedback) 因 sprint 未实装暂时移出 sprint-evidence 范围（保留作 paper §3 method discussion 中的工具链 ready 列项 + future work 占位）。sprint 实证以 C1 / C2 / C3 / C4 + scenariogen 自管 6-mutation 为主。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:48:1. **In-loop multi-source deterministic verifier feedback**：parse + semantic + simulation 三路并列接入 generation loop，覆盖 syntax / semantics / executability 3 个正交维度。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:50:3. **Scenariogen self-managed mutation coverage as in-loop bug-finding probes**（v4 新加，Phase E v3 (f) 实装）：scenariogen 后跑 6-mutation 覆盖率自检，覆盖率不足自动 retry。所有 baseline 都不做这种\"以 mutation 覆盖率反向驱动 scenario 充分性\"的反馈环。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:51:4. **Speculative validation from runtime**：pyfcstm `SimulationRuntime` 直接给，PlantUML / Umple / Mermaid / TTool 都不直接给。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:52:5. **Reference-free 4-intrinsic + optional audit-trail calibration evaluation protocol**：4 个 intrinsic 指标（去 JudgeScore）+ 可选的小规模 LLM-初审-人类签字 audit-trail 抽查作为 intrinsic 可信度桥。**这一条本身可作为独立 contribution 发表**，独立于具体 agent loop architecture。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:56:完整 Umple rebuttal 口径见 [2026-04-14 讨论稿](../discussions/2026-04-14-23-03-54-AI-讨论-pyfcstm作为LLM建模论文目标形式的必要性与Umple-rebuttal口径.md) §7。Path 2 sprint 阶段**不主打 DSL 本身贡献**；与 Umple 的差异由 pyfcstm `SimulationRuntime` 的 speculative validation + `topology` 的 reachability witness 自然落地，不在 §2 related work 中正面 PK。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:73:python -c \"from pyfcstm.dsl import parse_with_grammar_entry; print('ok')\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:74:python -c \"from pyfcstm.simulate import SimulationRuntime; print('ok')\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:78:#    python -c \"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, 'project_ex1_llm_judge_for_stm/src'); from expert_review.agent import ExpertReviewAgent; print('ok')\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:112:| `HSM-layered` | 6 | 含层次状态 / composite state / 子机的层次状态机 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:180:# result.scenariogen_coverage  含 Phase E v3 (f) 的 6-mutation 覆盖率自检结果\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:183:Path 2 特有：**不需要 reference**，evaluation 走 4-intrinsic（parse / sem / sim / reach）而非 component F1。可选 §6 audit-trail 抽查时使用 [`../eval/`](../eval/) 基础设施做小规模 manual eval 校准。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:206:def get_default_model() -> str:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:224:python -m method.run_path2 \\\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:253:实现：`pyfcstm.model.parse_dsl_node_to_state_machine` 是否抛 semantic exception（含 missing state / dangling transition / undefined var）。**分母 $N'$ 只算 Parse 通过的样本**（约束式定义），不要用所有 $N$。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:265:$$\\text{ReachRate}_i = \\frac{|\\{s \\in S_i : s \\text{ is reachable from initial state}\\}|}{|S_i|}$$\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:279:> JudgeScore 留作正式 paper 阶段补充（可作为单独 contribution 发表\"in-loop LLM judge 作为 STM 评测信号的方法与可信度评估\"）。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:283:从 20 cases 抽 3-5 case 走 [`../eval/`](../eval/) LLM-初审 + 人类签字 5-component manual eval，把抽查得到的人类 F1 与对应 sample 的 4-intrinsic mean 算 Pearson 相关：\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:287:PYTHONPATH=. python eval/demo/run_demo.py \\\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:290:  --component-kinds states,transitions,guards,actions,hierarchical_states\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:294:PYTHONPATH=. python eval/demo/finalize_after_signoff.py\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:299:只在 intrinsic lift 显著 + 想验证可信度时做；不是 sprint 强制步骤，但能为 paper 提供\"reference-free intrinsic 与 manual gold 相关性\"的实证桥（这是 §1.3 contribution 5 \"reference-free protocol\" 的可信度支撑）。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:314:- scenariogen_coverage: list[dict]  # Phase E v3 (f) 6-mutation 覆盖率自检（仅 A_full_ours 非空）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:358:5. **§5 信号判定**：按 [discussion §4.1](../discussions/2026-05-26-15-30-00-AI-讨论-第一篇论文agent-loop闭环2日冲刺计划.md) 的 S1/S2/S3/S4 把当前数据归类\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:361:8. **§8 后续 paper 工作量预估**：若选 Path 2，1-2 个月内要补的工作（接 Phase H judge 补回 5-intrinsic / 扩 sources/ 到 60 条 / intrinsic-F1 Pearson calibration 用全集补 manual 标注 / 对照 llms_emp 两阶段 / 对照 ttool-ai 自动反馈 / cross-vendor 等）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:370:| Intrinsic lift 过低（4-metric mean $< 15$pp） | `A_full_ours` 没比 `A0_baseline` 好多少 | 按 [discussion §4.1](../discussions/2026-05-26-15-30-00-AI-讨论-第一篇论文agent-loop闭环2日冲刺计划.md) S4 处理，在 PATH2_REPORT §7 给出\"信号弱\"判定，由用户综合判断 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:372:| 可选 audit-trail 抽查中双 LLM 一致率过低 | `eval/review/packs/` 中 🔴 / 🟡 行占比 $> 30\\%$ | 仅影响该 case，不阻塞 4-intrinsic 主指标；在 PATH2_REPORT §6 列分歧分布；如必要可全 abandon 抽查、保留纯 4-intrinsic 结果 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:373:| `LLM_API_KEY` / `LLM_ENDPOINT` 未 source | 跑实验时 KeyError on `os.environ[\"LLM_ENDPOINT\"]` | shell 跑 `source .env` 后重新执行；这是 Phase 0 自检必须 verify 的 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:387:## 11. Method + Contribution 详述（paper writing 直接复用素材）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:389:> 本节集中讲清楚 Path 2 视角下我们的 method 是什么、contribution 是什么；既给 sprint 末 PATH2_REPORT.md §7 (Claude 方向建议) 提供 anchored framing，也给方向定后正式 paper §1 contributions + §3 method 提供直接可复用的写作素材。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:398:      |  6 步 MTI 流水 (identify_state → identify_event → identify_variable →\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:399:      |                identify_transition → identify_action → build_pyfcstm)\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:420:  next_model --> 回到 Feedback Sources, iterate N=3 rounds\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:423:  final_model (pyfcstm DSL) --> 进入 §6 4 个 intrinsic 指标计算（+ 可选 audit-trail 抽查）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:430:1. **MTI 6-step Multi-step Modeler**（PR #11 Phase F 实装）：NL → 6 步流水（identify_state → identify_event → identify_variable → identify_transition → identify_action → build_pyfcstm）→ pyfcstm DSL\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:434:2. **ScenarioGen**（PR #11 Phase G+E v3 实装）：NL + 模型 → 多 step BDD scenarios + 6 mutation 覆盖率自检\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:435:   - **scenariogen self-validation**：scenariogen 后自动跑 6-mutation 覆盖率检查；任一类未被 catch → 用 `extra_directive` retry 直到覆盖\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:438:   - 按 earliest-failing channel 路由；fix_sim 含 passing-scenarios 显式 preservation 段\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:442:| Source | pyfcstm 入口 | 输出 schema 核心字段 | 在 paper §3 method 里是哪一条 contribution |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:445:| Semantic | `pyfcstm.model.parse_dsl_node_to_state_machine` | `{ok, missing_states, dangling_transitions, undefined_vars, type_mismatches}` | C3 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:446:| Sim | `pyfcstm.simulate.SimulationRuntime` + scenariogen 多 step BDD probes（含 6-mutation 自检）| `{ok, scenario_violations, per_step_var_mismatches, runtime_error}` | **C3 + C4 + scenariogen self-managed mutation coverage** |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:452:- **scenariogen frozen-once**：scenarios 在 iter 循环外生成一次 + mutation 覆盖率自检；model 适配 scenarios 不反向\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:456:### 11.3 Contribution 详述（**Path 2 视角：method 为主 + 强化 pyfcstm → 控制系统价值论证**）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:458:> **v4 修订（含 v4.1）**：原 v3 把 \"Reference-free intrinsic + judge protocol\" 与 \"control system NL benchmark\" 作 C1/C2 主 contribution，已撤销。v4.1 进一步根据用户反馈**删除原 C5 (Four-level event scoping + DSL-native module composition)**（理由：太侧重工程，不构成 paper-level method contribution），同时**新增 §11.3.0 三段论 framing 论证**（pyfcstm feature → LLM agent loop 能力 → 控制系统价值），把\"为什么 pyfcstm 特性更贴合控制系统\"这一论证链显式写清楚。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:469:2. **数值密集的守卫 / 效果**：控制系统 transition guard 含大量**复合数值条件**（温度阈值 / 距离阈值 / 流量约束 / 时序去抖 / 边沿检测）；effect 含 PID 计算 / 状态变量更新 / 累积量推进\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:473:这 4 个本质区别决定了\"通用 LLM-based STM 工具链（Umple / PlantUML / Mermaid / SysML / TTool）在控制系统场景下不胜任\"的根本原因 — 不是工具链不能\"画\"控制系统状态机，而是**它们不在 generation loop 中暴露上述 4 类需求所需的 grounding signal**。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:481:| `SimulationRuntime` 内 deepcopy-snapshot speculative DFS validation + structured `SimulationRuntimeDfsError` (`pyfcstm/simulate/runtime.py:_validate_transition`) | agent 在每轮 repair 前能拿到\"这条 transition 触发后该 mode 的子状态机能否 reach stable boundary\"的 ground-truth 反馈，及具体 dead-end 模式（init 全失败 / pseudo 不停 / guard 互锁 / exit-vs-parent 循环） | 控制系统**多模式切换**（mode A → mode B）中\"切过去后 mode B 子状态机无合法 init\"这类 critical bug 在 generation 阶段就被识别，无需等到 deploy 后 runtime 死机；agent 拿到诊断后能定向修复 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:482:| `Expr` IR + `pyfcstm/solver/` Z3 集成（`expr_to_z3` / `execute_operations` / `solve`） | agent 在每轮 repair 前能拿到\"这条 transition 的 guard 是否可达 (SAT)\" / \"effect 后变量空间是否满足下一 invariant\" 的 SMT-grade 反馈，覆盖 22 个数学函数闭包 | 控制系统**数值密集 guard** (温度阈值、流量约束、传感器去抖、PID 计算后续条件) 可被符号求解；agent 能发现\"这条 guard 在变量定义域内永不为真\"或\"effect 后违反 safety invariant\"这类静态可证伪逻辑错误 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:483:| `>> during before/after` aspect actions (root→leaf→root cascade) + `!` forced transition (模型层递归展开到所有 descendant) | agent 可生成**跨所有叶子的 cross-cutting 行为**（监控、日志、安全断言）无需为每个 leaf 复制；可一行声明 fault-recovery escape 自动展开到所有适用子状态 | 控制系统**周期执行范式 + 强 safety invariant**：一行 `>> during after abstract AssertSafetyInvariant` 表达\"任意 mode 下每周期都要检查安全上限\"；**强 fault-recovery**：一行 `! * -> ErrorHandler :: Error` 表达\"任意工作 mode 下 Error 都强制切到安全状态\"；Umple 都需要在每一 mode level 手抄 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:484:| `enter abstract` / `during abstract` / `>> during before abstract` + `@abstract_handler` decorator + `ReadOnlyExecutionContext` (frozen) | agent 可在 generation 阶段产出**hardware-effector 占位符**不需要决定 deployment target；handler 在 runtime 反射注入，frozen context 防止 handler 修改 vars；两档错误处理（raise / log）把 handler 异常落到 structured field 供 agent 消费 | 控制系统**硬件解耦需求**：同一 STM 模型在 PC 仿真 / RTOS / 嵌入式 MCU 之间无修改部署；测试时 mock handler、deploy 时实硬件 handler；STM 模型保持\"语义骨架\"不动 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:490:1. **Umple**：guard 是 host-language 代码片段，没有 language-independent IR → 无法 SMT 求解；no speculative validation → 死锁 / 不可达 transition 只在 codegen 后运行时暴露；no DSL-native aspect AOP → 控制系统 invariant 要手抄；no DSL-level abstract action → lifecycle hook 直接写宿主语言代码\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:491:2. **PlantUML / Mermaid**：纯渲染工具，**没有 runtime / simulation / verification 能力** — 在控制系统 LLM agent loop 中只是\"画状态机的工具\"，无 grounding signal\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:492:3. **ttool-ai**：有 JSON syntax check 但**没有 speculative validation**、**没有 Z3 solver**、**没有 aspect AOP**；TTool simulator 是 post-hoc 评分支撑，**不在 generation loop 内**\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:493:4. **IEC 61499 iterative refinement**：有 softPLC simulation 但**需要人类评论介入**驱动迭代；不是 fully automated\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:496:因此，**pyfcstm 在 LLM-based control system STM synthesis 任务中的不可替代性，不是\"它有什么独家 feature\"，而是\"它把控制系统建模所需的 4 类 grounding signal（dead-end check / SMT 可达性 / cross-cutting + forced escape / hardware decoupling）全部做在了一个 fully-automated DSL toolchain 之内\"**。这是 Path 2 paper 的 method core 的真正立论基础，也是 §11.3 下面 4 条 C1-C4 contribution 的统一 framing 锚点。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:500:Path 2 视角下我们的 5 条 contribution（前 4 条 method core，第 5 条 evidence + enabling tooling）。**Path 2 与 Path 1 的差异**：method core (C1-C4) 是 paper-wide 一致的 4 条；但 Path 2 强化每条 method core 与控制系统具体场景的对应关系；evidence section 用 sources/ 真实工业控制系统 NL 而非家电 benchmark。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:504:> \"We integrate pyfcstm's cycle-based simulation runtime — featuring per-cycle deepcopy-snapshot speculative DFS validation bounded by 1000 steps, 64 stack frames, and structural-and-value signature pruning (`pyfcstm/simulate/runtime.py:_validate_transition`) — as a deterministic in-loop feedback source. The runtime rejects transitions whose downstream init / pseudo / parent-continuation chains cannot reach a stoppable boundary, and surfaces a structured `SimulationRuntimeDfsError` whose docstring enumerates pathological STM patterns.\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:506:**控制系统场景对应**：当 LLM 生成包含**多模式切换的控制器**时（如电梯模式切换、PLC 阶段控制、自动驾驶 supervisor mode 转换），speculative validation 能识别\"某条 mode transition 触发后该 mode 的子状态机没有合法 init\"这类病态。这对 Umple/PlantUML/Mermaid 这些**不在 runtime 层做 dead-end 检测**的工具链是无法替代的 grounding。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:508:#### C2 — Language-independent expression IR enables symbolic reasoning without code generation（**method core，控制系统场景的关键 enabler**）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:510:> \"The DSL ships a unified `Expr` IR (`pyfcstm/model/expr.py`) supporting arithmetic / bitwise / logical / ternary / 22-function math closure required by state-machine guards and effects. The same IR is simultaneously (a) evaluable, (b) AST-round-trippable, (c) Z3-translatable via `pyfcstm/solver/expr.py:expr_to_z3`, and (d) renderable into 9 target languages. We exploit it to provide LLM agents with **guard SMT satisfiability** (`pyfcstm/solver/solve.py:solve`) and **symbolic effect propagation** (`pyfcstm/solver/operation.py:execute_operations`) as in-loop feedback — without ever leaving the DSL toolchain.\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:515:def int debounce_count = 0;\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:518:state Wait {\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:519:    during {\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:524:Wait -> Triggered : if [debounce_count >= 5 && abs(temp - target) < threshold] effect { debounce_count = 0; };\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:527:Z3-backed solver 让 agent loop 可以问\"这条 transition 的 guard 是否可达？\"\"effect 后变量空间满足下一 invariant 吗？\" — Umple 的 host-language-bound guards 做不到。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:531:> \"We design our method around two pyfcstm DSL-level primitives that Umple, PlantUML, and Mermaid lack: (i) **aspect actions** `>> during before / after` cascading from root to leaf states at every cycle (`pyfcstm/model/model.py:iter_on_during_aspect_recursively`); and (ii) **forced transitions** `!` recursively expanded to every applicable descendant substate (`pyfcstm/model/model.py:_recursive_finish_states`).\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:538:state MotorControl {\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:539:    >> during before { tick = tick + 1; }              // 每周期递增 watchdog\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:540:    >> during after abstract AssertSafetyInvariant;    // 每周期注入 safety invariant 检查\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:541:    state Running { during { command_torque = kp * (target - position); } }\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:542:    state Stopped { during { command_torque = 0; } }\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:546:`>> during after` 在任意活跃叶子状态后都自动注入（root→leaf→root cascade），对应\"任意 mode 下 invariant 都必须 hold\"。Umple 要在每个叶子的 `do` 内手抄一遍。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:548:**Forced transition** `!` = 控制系统\"任何模式下 Error 触发必须切到 ErrorHandler\"的一行 declarative encoding：\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:551:state Plant {\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:552:    ! * -> ErrorHandler :: Error;   // 任何子状态下 Error 都强制 escape\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:553:    state Idle;\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:554:    state Running { state Phase1; state Phase2; [*] -> Phase1; }\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:555:    state ErrorHandler { enter abstract NotifyOperator; }\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:559:Umple 需要手写每一层 escape 或借助 nested state 隐含规则（agent report §6.3）。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:561:#### C4 — Abstract action + read-only context decouples symbolic STM from physical effectors（**method core，控制系统硬件解耦**）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:563:> \"Combining DSL-level abstract action declarations with Python-side `@abstract_handler` decorator and `ReadOnlyExecutionContext` (`pyfcstm/simulate/decorators.py` + `context.py`) lets the LLM synthesize STMs without committing to a deployment target.\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:565:**控制系统场景对应**：控制系统 STM 在生成阶段**不应该决定 deployment target**（PC 仿真 / RTOS / PLC / 嵌入式 MCU / ROS 节点）。pyfcstm 通过 DSL 级 abstract action 占位 + 反射式 handler 注入实现彻底解耦：\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:568:state CalibrationMode {\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:569:    enter { offset = 0; samples = 0; }\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:570:    enter abstract OpenValve;                          // hardware-specific, placeholder\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:571:    during { offset = offset + read_sensor(); samples = samples + 1; }\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:572:    exit { offset = offset / samples; }\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:573:    exit abstract CloseValve;                          // hardware-specific, placeholder\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:577:Python 侧：\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:589:#### C5 — Empirical demonstration on real industrial control system NL + reference-free evaluation enabling tooling（**evidence + enabling tooling，NOT core contribution**）\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:591:> \"We demonstrate the method on a 20-case T0 subset of [sources/](../sources/), spanning 9 real industrial control system domains. Since canonical reference STMs do not exist for real industrial requirements (the same NL can be modeled as multiple semantically-equivalent STMs), we develop a reference-free evaluation protocol combining four intrinsic metrics (`ParseRate`, `SemValidRate`, `SimRate`, `ReachabilityRate`) and (optionally) calibrate it against a small-scale audit-trail manual evaluation on 3-5 cases using a dual-LLM-assisted, expert-signed protocol (see [eval/](../eval/)). The protocol and benchmark are **enabling tooling** that makes the method's evaluation feasible in this domain, not the method itself. LLM-as-judge as an additional in-loop semantic signal is planned for the post-sprint paper phase (currently Phase H is skipped).\"\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:593:**Path 2 关键 framing**：我们**不与 baseline 的家电/通用 reactive system/domain model 一般性方法竞争** — 我们只干 baseline 工具链干不了的事：在真实工业控制系统 NL 上做 fully-automated grounded synthesis。reference-free protocol + sources/ benchmark 是让 method core (C1-C4) **能在这个差异化领域被实验验证的 supporting infrastructure**。core contribution 是 method 本身（C1-C4，且每条都对应 §11.3.0 三段论 framing 论证的一行）。\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:599:| # | 类别 | contribution | 对应 pyfcstm feature | 控制系统场景价值 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:601:| 1 | **method** | In-loop deterministic feedback via speculative validation | `SimulationRuntime` DFS validation + `SimulationRuntimeDfsError` | 多模式切换 dead-end 识别 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:602:| 2 | **method** | Language-independent expression IR enables symbolic reasoning | `Expr` IR + `solver/` Z3 集成 + 跨 9 语言渲染 | 复杂数值守卫 + Z3 可达性 + 跨部署目标 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:603:| 3 | **method** | DSL-native aspect AOP + forced fault paths | `>> during before/after` + `!` forced transition | per-tick invariant + 强制 fault-recovery escape |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/paper_v1/PATH2_DIFFERENTIATION_GUIDE.md:604:| 4 | **method** | Abstract action + read-only context for effector-agnostic STM synthesis | `enter abstract` + `@abstract_handler` + `ReadOnlyExecutionContext` | 硬件解耦 + handler 反射注入 |\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/langgraph/test_foundation.py:1:\"\"\"LG-M1-D1 LangGraph foundation split characterization tests.\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/langgraph/test_foundation.py:3:These tests lock the D1 contract only: foundation modules exist, the public\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/langgraph/test_foundation.py:6:runtime state or behavior into ``method.langgraph``.\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/langgraph/test_foundation.py:25:def _load_baseline() -> dict[str, Any]:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/langgraph/test_foundation.py:29:def _sha256_json(payload: object) -> str:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/langgraph/test_foundation.py:34:def _stable_graph_contract(registry: dict[str, Any], consistency: dict[str, Any], planned_stage_order: list[str]) -> dict[str, Any]:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/langgraph/test_foundation.py:67:def test_lg_m1_d1_foundation_modules_do_not_reverse_import_runti