slp >= -0.01`\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:42:// Reference state machine for the ABS hydraulic regulator (3-state FSM).\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:44:// states + per-state outputs:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:45:state increase   // outputs k1=1, k2=0, n=0\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:46:state hold       // outputs k1=0, k2=0, n=0\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:47:state decrease   // outputs k1=0, k2=1, n=500\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:49:// transitions (slp = slip-error from PID):\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:50:increase -> hold     when [slp <= 0.01]\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:51:hold     -> increase when [slp >  0.01]\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:52:hold     -> decrease when [slp < -0.01]\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:53:decrease -> hold     when [slp >= -0.01]\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:60:state increase   // k1=1, k2=0, n=0\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:61:state hold       // k1=0, k2=0, n=0\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:62:state decrease   // k1=0, k2=1, n=500\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pr