 same outputs.\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:134:## #3 ✅  ref `s2` ↔ pred `p2`  <!-- row003 -->\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:136:- **ref 实例**：`decrease`；原文：`state decrease — k1=0, k2=1, n=500 (release)`\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:137:- **pred 实例**：`decrease`；原文：`state decrease — release k1=0, k2=1, n=500`\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:142:  理由：Reference state decrease with release outputs k1=0, k2=1, n=500 exactly matches predicted state decrease with the same release outputs.\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/eval/review/packs/abs-fsm-brake-control/pred_perfect/states.md:157:- **Claude**：TP=3, FP=0, FN=0；notes：Prediction is identical to reference; all three states match exactly by name and outputs.\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/llm/test_gpt_client.py:11:def test_gpt_client_default_request_timeout_is_fail_fast(monkeypatch: pytest.MonkeyPatch) -> None:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/llm/test_gpt_client.py:17:def test_gpt_client_request_timeout_can_be_overridden(monkeypatch: pytest.MonkeyPatch) -> None:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/llm/test_gpt_client.py:23:def test_gpt_client_request_timeout_can_be_disabled_for_diagnostics(monkeypatch: pytest.MonkeyPatch) -> None:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/llm/test_gpt_client.py:29:def test_gpt_client_request_timeout_rejects_invalid_value(monkeypatch: pytest.MonkeyPatch) -> None:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/llm/test_gpt_client.py:36:def test_gpt_client_disables_sdk_hidden_retries(monkeypatch: pytest.MonkeyPatch) -> None:\nproject_1_llm_state_machine_modeling/method/tests/llm/test_gpt_client.py:40:        def __init__(self, **kwargs: objec