{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"agent_message","text":"SD-6 暴露出 runtime 层的真实问题：transition 上用了事件名，但没有显式 `event` 声明，导致仿真时无法从当前叶状态解析 `StartAC`。我会按通用 FCSTM 规则补齐事件声明，而不是改 scenario 去绕过错误。"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_65","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"PYTHONPATH=project_1_llm_state_machine_modeling python - <<'PY'\nfrom method.schema import StageContext, TestScenario, ScenarioStep\nfrom method.stages.api import run_sd2_parse, run_sd3_semantic, run_sd4_design, run_sd6_sim, freeze_scenario_set\nimport hashlib\n\nbase_events='''\n    event BuiltInSwitchSet;\n    event SetDefaultFlow;\n    event InitiateAC;\n    event ChangeSetpoint;\n    event StartAC;\n    event AutoReady;\n    event ControlTick;\n    event TerminateAC;\n    event PumpFault;\n    event FaultRemoved;\n    event CA_backManual;\n    event CB_backManual;\n    event CP_backManual;\n    event CC_backManual;\n'''\n\ndsl = r'''\ndef int CA_mode = 0;\ndef int shared_bp_buffer = 80;\ndef int blood_pressure = 80;\ndef int target_bp = 80;\ndef int default_flow_rate = 1;\ndef int pump_speed_source = 0;\ndef int control_voltage = 0;\ndef int infusion_rate = 1;\ndef int log_written = 0;\ndef int alarm_signal = 0;\ndef int error_message = 0;\ndef int software_control = 0;\ndef int pump_control_released = 0;\nstate CARA {\n    event BuiltInSwitchSet;\n    event SetDefaultFlow;\n    event InitiateAC;\n    event ChangeSetpoint;\n    event StartAC;\n    event AutoReady;\n    event ControlTick;\n    event TerminateAC;\n    event PumpFault;\n    event FaultRemoved;\n    event CA_backManual;\n    event CB_backManual;\n    event CP_backManual;\n    event CC_backManual;\n    [*] -> Mode_Control_Algorithm;\n    state Mode_Control_Algorithm {\n        \"'! * -> Manual :: /CA_backManual;\n        ! * -> Manual :: /CB_backManual;\n        ! * -> Manual :: /CP_backManual;\n        ! * -> Manual :: /CC_backManual;\n        >> during before {\n            shared_bp_buffer = blood_pressure;\n        }\n        [*] -> Wait;\n        state Wait { enter { CA_mode = 0; software_control = 0; pump_speed_source = 0; } }\n        state Manual { enter { CA_mode = 0; software_control = 0; pump_speed_source = 0; pump_control_released = 0; alarm_signal = 0; error_message = 0; } during { infusion_rate = default_flow_rate; control_voltage = 0; } }\n        state Ask_StartAC { [*] -> AwaitingStart; state AwaitingStart; enter { CA_mode = 1; software_control = 0; } AwaitingStart -> AwaitingStart :: /ChangeSetpoint effect { target_bp = target_bp + 1; } }\n        state AutocontrolInit { enter { CA_mode = 2; software_control = 1; pump_speed_source = 1; pump_control_released = 0; log_written = 1; } }\n        state Autocontrol { enter { CA_mode = 3; software_control = 1; pump_speed_source = 1; pump_control_released = 0; } during { shared_bp_buffer = blood_pressure; infusion_rate = (blood_pressure > target_bp) ? 1 : 2; control_voltage = infusion_rate; log_written = 1; } }\n        state PumpFault { enter { alarm_signal = 1; error_message = 1; } }\n        Wait -> Manual :: /BuiltInSwitchSet;\n        Manual -> Manual :: /SetDefaultFlow effect { default_flow_rate = default_flow_rate + 1; }\n        Manual -> Ask_StartAC :: /InitiateAC;\n        Ask_StartAC -> Ask_StartAC :: /ChangeSetpoint effect { target_bp = target_bp + 1; }\n        Ask_StartAC -> AutocontrolInit :: /StartAC;\n        Ask_StartAC -> Manual :: /TerminateAC;\n        AutocontrolInit -> Autocontrol :: /AutoReady;\n        AutocontrolInit -> Manual :: /TerminateAC;\n        AutocontrolInit -> PumpFault :: /PumpFault effect { software_control = 0; pump_control_released = 1; }\n        Autocontrol -> Autocontrol :: /ControlTick;\n        Autocontrol -> Manual :: /TerminateAC;\n        Autocontrol -> PumpFault :: /PumpFault effect { software_control = 0; pump_control_released = 1; }\n        Manual -> PumpFault :: /PumpFault effect { software_control = 0; pump_control_released = 0; }\n        PumpFault -> Manual :: /FaultRemoved;\n    }\n}\n'\"'''\nctx=StageContext(nl='The controller reads blood_pressure as an external sensor input. Pump events switch modes.', current_dsl=dsl)\nprint('sd2', run_sd2_par